<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Drone Forensic Report — {{ case.case_id }}</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif; margin: 2rem; color: #1a1a1a; background: #fff; }
  h1 { border-bottom: 3px solid #16324f; padding-bottom: .3rem; }
  h2 { color: #16324f; margin-top: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: .2rem; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: .5rem 0 1.5rem; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: .4rem .6rem; text-align: left; font-size: .92rem; }
  th { background: #eef1f5; }
  .mono { font-family: "Consolas", monospace; font-size: .85rem; word-break: break-all; }
  .warn { color: #8a5300; background: #fff6e5; border: 1px solid #f0c36d; padding: .5rem .8rem; border-radius: 4px; margin: .3rem 0; }
  .not-implemented { color: #6b1f1f; background: #fdecec; border: 1px solid #e0a1a1; padding: .5rem .8rem; border-radius: 4px; }
  .badge-ok { color: #14532d; background: #e7f6ec; border: 1px solid #9fd8b2; padding: .1rem .5rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .8rem; }
  .footer { margin-top: 3rem; font-size: .8rem; color: #666; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: .5rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Drone Forensic Report</h1>
<p><strong>Case ID:</strong> {{ case.case_id }}<br>
<strong>Examiner:</strong> {{ case.examiner }}<br>
<strong>Case created:</strong> {{ case.created_at }}<br>
<strong>Description:</strong> {{ case.description or "—" }}<br>
<strong>Report generated:</strong> {{ generated_at }}</p>

<h2>1. Evidence Inventory</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Evidence ID</th><th>Original filename</th><th>Platform</th><th>Acquired at</th><th>SHA-256</th></tr>
{% for e in case.evidence %}
<tr>
  <td class="mono">{{ e.evidence_id[:8] }}</td>
  <td>{{ e.original_filename }}</td>
  <td>{{ e.platform }}</td>
  <td>{{ e.acquired_at }}</td>
  <td class="mono">{{ e.sha256 }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<h2>2. Chain of Custody Integrity</h2>
<p>
Chain-of-custody log verification:
{% if custody_verification.ok %}
<span class="badge-ok">VERIFIED — {{ custody_verification.entry_count }} entries, hash chain intact</span>
{% else %}
<span class="not-implemented">BROKEN at entry #{{ custody_verification.first_broken_seq }}</span>
{% endif %}
</p>
<table>
<tr><th>#</th><th>Timestamp (UTC)</th><th>Action</th><th>Actor</th><th>Detail</th><th>Entry hash</th></tr>
{% for c in custody_entries %}
<tr>
  <td>{{ c.seq }}</td>
  <td>{{ c.timestamp }}</td>
  <td>{{ c.action }}</td>
  <td>{{ c.actor }}</td>
  <td>{{ c.detail }}</td>
  <td class="mono">{{ c.entry_hash[:16] }}…</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<h2>3. Per-Evidence Analysis</h2>
{% for a in analyses %}
<h3>{{ a.evidence.original_filename }} ({{ a.evidence.platform }})</h3>
{% if not a.result.implemented %}
<p class="not-implemented"><strong>Not analyzed:</strong> {{ a.result.warnings|join(" ") }}</p>
{% else %}
  {% if a.result.partial %}
  <p class="not-implemented"><strong>Partial analysis only</strong> — see warnings below for exactly what is and is not covered.</p>
  {% endif %}
  {% for w in a.result.warnings %}<p class="warn">{{ w }}</p>{% endfor %}
  <table>
  {% for k, v in a.result.flight_summary.items() %}
    <tr><th>{{ k }}</th><td>{{ v if v is not none else "—" }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </table>

  <h4>Timeline ({{ a.result.events|length }} events)</h4>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Timestamp (UTC)</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  {% for ev in a.result.events %}
  <tr><td>{{ ev.timestamp_utc }}</td><td>{{ ev.event_type }}</td><td>{{ ev.description }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </table>

  {% if a.result.flight_summary.get("airspace_incursions") %}
  <h4>Airspace / No-Fly-Zone Analysis</h4>
  {% for w in a.result.warnings %}{% if "static snapshot" in w %}<p class="warn">{{ w }}</p>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
  <table>
  <tr><th>Zone</th><th>Entry (UTC)</th><th>Exit (UTC)</th><th>Duration (s)</th><th>Track points</th></tr>
  {% for inc in a.incursions %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ inc.zone_name or "—" }}</td>
    <td>{{ inc.entry_ts or "—" }}</td>
    <td>{{ inc.exit_ts or "—" }}</td>
    <td>{{ "%.1f"|format(inc.duration_seconds) if inc.duration_seconds is not none else "—" }}</td>
    <td>{{ inc.point_count if inc.point_count is not none else "—" }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </table>
  {% endif %}

  <p>Flight path exported to: <span class="mono">{{ a.flight_path_kml }}</span>, <span class="mono">{{ a.flight_path_geojson }}</span></p>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<h2>4. Carved Media</h2>
{% if carved_files %}
<p>Signature-based file carving recovered {{ carved_files|length }} file(s) from removable-media
images processed for this case. See §5 for the scope limitations of this recovery method.</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Offset</th><th>Type</th><th>Size (bytes)</th><th>SHA-256</th><th>Source image</th><th>EXIF timestamp</th><th>EXIF GPS</th><th>Recovered file</th></tr>
{% for cf in carved_files %}
<tr>
  <td class="mono">{{ cf.offset }}</td>
  <td>{{ cf.file_type }}</td>
  <td>{{ cf.size }}</td>
  <td class="mono">{{ cf.sha256 }}</td>
  <td>{{ cf.source_filename }}</td>
  <td>{{ cf.exif.DateTimeOriginal if cf.exif and cf.exif.DateTimeOriginal else "—" }}</td>
  <td>
  {%- if cf.exif and cf.exif.GPSLatitude is defined and cf.exif.GPSLongitude is defined -%}
    {{ "%.6f"|format(cf.exif.GPSLatitude) }}, {{ "%.6f"|format(cf.exif.GPSLongitude) }}
  {%- else -%}
    —
  {%- endif -%}
  </td>
  <td class="mono">{{ cf.output_path }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>
<p class="warn">
<strong>Scope of carved media:</strong> these files were recovered by scanning the raw image for
known file-type magic bytes (JPEG/MP4/PNG signatures), independent of any filesystem metadata —
this toolkit does not parse the FAT/exFAT filesystem, so no claim is made about a recovered file's
original name, directory location, or deletion time. A file split across non-contiguous regions of
the image (fragmentation) carves as a truncated/corrupt file, flagged as such in the Type column
("&lt;type&gt;_truncated"), not silently reconstructed. Timestamp and GPS location, where shown
above, come solely from EXIF metadata embedded in the carved JPEG itself — carved files have no
filesystem timestamp of their own, so a file with no EXIF (or a non-JPEG type) shows no timing/
location data here.
</p>
{% else %}
<p>No media carving was performed for this case.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>5. Scope and Known Limitations</h2>
<p>This report only reflects analysis performed by the implemented parsers listed above.
See docs/design_document.md for the full toolkit architecture and the acquisition/parsing
status of platforms not yet implemented (DJI proprietary logs, remote controller physical
acquisition, mobile companion app extraction).</p>

<div class="footer">
Generated by Drone Forensic Toolkit v{{ toolkit_version }} — PUSHPAK Grand Challenge 3, Objective 1.
This report and the underlying evidence hashes should be independently re-verified before use in
legal proceedings.
</div>

</body>
</html>
